Ported from crates/bevy_pbr/src/atmosphere (transmittance_lut.wgsl, multiscattering_lut.wgsl,
functions.wgsl, bruneton_functions.wgsl), tag v0.19.1, fetched 2026-10-02, into:

  apps/hyperion/src/renderer/src/view/atmosphere/shaders/common.wgsl
